 "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036703_576173451444056_2815308939854354726_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r46hqdn6fLkQ7kNvwH1Kd6J&_nc_oc=AdrpgeGekRPs6nB1jtwmZi6kf_nX7Vx3EM0QZbZbsjreQzFUx4zXnFOlK5BoKMGApIA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKh-QXleTeoeUsn8tsIGuySjdq8K7IppZxM8CE6AMbofg&oe=6A9C2468"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot D.png", "id": "480971648434463", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001662_480971655101129_6064421927720784354_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hsmSM46iJIMQ7kNvwGHifBC&_nc_oc=AdreJkXgPoa4DHfGa-I-uuSCngNHQkrq4zyQAmQFY4EvoOuMajnTytCMSuscOnCY--A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQgNtoOEZPjGfaR-IYitK_xPxkTnYTBfEPc5lhmb1FWg&oe=6A9C1CC8"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot C.png", "id": "1683707145528823", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75508956_1683707148862156_8286553196679635241_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jL0fKljwjpgQ7kNvwGDZgHL&_nc_oc=AdoOMuugoAGzvzWqHFl6RzJCuR1qwICIPzp2ixGoIKKRQSeDmDDbhVHdTxCxBDPmXnU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI7UYIwKIWR2Isow9xa4Bf-jm1d-uKIq6onr3qA0pmdYw&oe=6A9C1254"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cues Landscape v2.png", "id": "1206096493787337", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_1206096497120670_6286030136535771041_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NYS61O4s3kMQ7kNvwFvFYaK&_nc_oc=AdpomRA5scwTfTHNvhEy748Q3P7_1_00GIYj7gcUqW63nkeh6HMNOvRaAUbpcR9_R30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJD4PQNixdrBk6DyqBx-Yl4E770DyXmOB64WbnMz-VF_Q&oe=6A9C3B3B"}, "display_name": "Cues", "keywords": ["brick", "breaker", "mixed", "hand", "magic"], "long_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with **Cues**. Dive into a **hand-tracking** experience where music meets motion. \n\n**NEW:** Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\n- \u201cIt looks amazing. One of the coolest looking MR games I\u2019ve seen\u201d \u2013 Matt BMFVR\n\n{557242276938737}\n\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a **dynamically evolving symphony** influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises.\n\nIdeal for brief, engaging sessions, 'Cues' converts any room into a vibrant arena of musical puzzles.\n", "short_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with Cues. Dive into a hand-tracking experience where music meets motion. \n\nNEW: Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a dynamically evolving symphony influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises."}]}, "developer_name": "No Ragrets Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "publisher_name": "PotamWorks SAS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua